{
 "name": "arc98",
 "title": "Ghost",
 "about": "~98 s arc cut, forward only through the 8 stages (room -> tunnel entrance -> depths -> flower pool -> light above / emerge -> flight to the tree -> union -> light amidst the cosmos; never back to the room). Music: 0:00-0:39 | 1:24.2-1:40 | 2:43.2-3:05.8 | 3:12.6-3:39.4, equal-power crossfades centred on 0:38=1:25.2 (the 1:25 gathering), the 1:39 cadence = 2:44.2, and 3:04.6 = 3:13.8 (after the 3:04 cadence). NO literal figure: every still is a figure-free crop of the pack still, or (cosmos) has the tiny figure inpainted away; the angel exists only as particle wings. No flashes: the kiosk's bass flashes become slow push-ins; the amber shaft eases in over 6 s to the 2:58 climax (film 65.6).",
